    "0.5 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "2 (12 ounce) jars peach preserves",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 (8 ounce) container whipped topping",
    "2 (8 inch) prepared graham cracker crusts",
    "freshly sliced peaches for garnish"
